he given statements.\n\n- Statements I is true. The rectangle $R$ covers the region $D$ completely.\n\n- Statement II is false. The integrals have not been stated correctly with respect to the domains $R$ and $D$ (they have been swapped).\n\n- Statements III is true. The rectangle $R$ covers the region $D$ completely.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14053940/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ba070c31df4aea7547970c11967ad40de40a2802a40ff487f43c7e94a60c13c"} {"question" "q-80567" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14053940/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1dd6b5880f7162c5e89d5d9a910fa55ae62fc84f22fc6ebcef9e0368d226dae3"} {"question" "q-80567" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14053940/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ba070c31df4aea7547970c11967ad40de40a2802a40ff487f43c7e94a60c13c"} {"question" "q-80567" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "I and II only"] ["text" "I and III only"] ["text" "I only"] ["text" "II and III only"] ["text" "III only"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14053940/state.json" "file_sha256" "3ba070c31df4aea7547970c11967ad40de40a2802a40ff487f43c7e94a60c13c"} {"question" "q-80567" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/text "I and III only"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable